al_Cloak_of_the_Wolf.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"341\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Wolf.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar_Challenge_Pack\" title=\"Eveningstar Challenge Pack\">Eveningstar Challenge Pack</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Wolf\" title=\"Item:Adamantine Cloak of the Wolf\">Adamantine Cloak of the Wolf</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>The interior of this cloak is reinforced with a lightweight chainmail mesh, providing extra protection while retaining ease of movement.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>Upgrade to <a href=\"/page/Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Wolf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Adamantine Cloak of the Wolf\">Adamantine Cloak of the Wolf</a> by turning in 800 Platinum Tricrowns, 4000 Copper Thumb), 1600 Enchanted Moss, 1600 Fey Toadstools, <a href=\"/page/Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Wolf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mithral Cloak of the Wolf\">Mithral Cloak of the Wolf</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817222540\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.143 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3146/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21773/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6429/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion